### Step 2: Add User Badge Container

Add to your MkDocs theme template (e.g., `overrides/main.html`):

```html
{% extends "base.html" %}

{% block header %}
  {{ super() }}
  <div id="user-badge-container"></div>
{% endblock %}
```
